      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{68098a4626271974ef4d2775|full_name} There definitely needs to be different \"modes\".\n\n➜ \"Tilt Steering\" — Sit on broom, tilt/turn to steer, lean/look up/down for altitude, Trigger/Use is forward momentum\n\n➜ \"Tank Controls\" — Hold/Sit-on broom, Left stick/WASD is altitude, right stick/Mouse is direction, trigger for forward movement (similar to current)\n\n➜ \"Directional\" — Hold broom, point in the direction you want to go, Use is movement in that direction (similar to current)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
