  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2026-10-04T22:55:52.003Z",
  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Using the magic broom that is available through the month of october, it is considerably unwieldy to fly, and provides no option to be sat upon.\n\nIdeally, a cleaner method of operation would be to sit upon the broom and lean, similar to a bike or skateboard, to fly in the given direction. Altitude would be dictated by looking up or down.\n\nThe current method of flying is highly unimmersive,  and generally unpleasant.\n\nThe saddens me as a magic broom is an item I was actually hoping for. I had been tempted to add something like that to my avatar using Gogo.",
